  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine pineapple juice, honey, ketchup, brown sugar, soy sauce, hoisin sauce, garlic, and ginger in a saucepan over medium heat. Whisk until well blended. Bring to a boil, stirring occasionally. Reduce heat to simmer; cook, stirring occasionally, until thickened, 25 to 30 minutes.",
